---
layout: default
title: CV
# Provide just the filename if it's in assets/pdf/, or a full/absolute URL otherwise
cv_pdf: cv.pdf
# Optional short blurb under the title
# description: Curriculum Vitae (PDF)
---

{%- comment -%}
Al-Folio–styled CV page that ONLY embeds a PDF (no list-based CV). Matches the
header structure and card aesthetics from the theme’s CV page you shared.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign _raw = page.cv_pdf | default: site.cv_pdf | default: 'cv.pdf' -%}
{%- assign _is_absolute = _raw contains '://' or _raw startswith '/' -%}
{%- if _is_absolute -%}
  {%- assign pdf_path = _raw -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign pdf_path = _raw | prepend: 'assets/pdf/' | relative_url -%}
{%- endif -%}

<div id="cv-embed-page" class="post cv-only">
  <header class="post-header">
    <h1 class="post-title">
      {{ page.title }}
      <a
        href="{{ pdf_path }}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="float-right"
        title="Open PDF in new tab"
      >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i>
      </a>
    </h1>
    {%- if page.description -%}
      <p class="post-description">{{ page.description }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </header>

  <article>
    <div class="cv">
      <div class="card mt-3 p-0">
        <!-- PDF Embed -->
        <object
          data="{{ pdf_path }}#view=FitH"
          type="application/pdf"
          class="pdf-embed"
        >
          <iframe
            src="{{ pdf_path }}#view=FitH"
            class="pdf-embed"
            title="CV PDF"
          ></iframe>
          <div class="p-3">
            Your browser can’t display embedded PDFs. You can
            <a href="{{ pdf_path }}">download the CV here</a>.
          </div>
        </object>

        <!-- Action row (matches al-folio card spacing/typography) -->
        <div class="p-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
          <div class="small text-muted">PDF last updated: {{ page.cv_updated | default: site.cv_updated | default: '' }}</div>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn-sm" href="{{ pdf_path }}" download>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i>
              <span class="ml-1">Download</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-sm" href="{{ pdf_path }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square"></i>
              <span class="ml-1">Open in new tab</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
